        "provides": "Fast, associative, pattern-based answer from what the system already knows — cortex's own intuition faculty (<50ms, no model call). Falls through to null if there is no confident answer; use analyze for a deeper, reasoned answer.",
        "updatedAt": 1789871665465,
        "_key": "intuition"
      },
      {
        "id": "mastermind",
        "consumers": [],
