        "provides": "Real fault/failure precedent for a component — not a fabricated risk score. Every tool call that errors already logs here automatically (no action needed for that). \"check\" (needs component, optional intent) returns real past faults for it, most recent first, with the real CFR conditions at the time — use this before a consequential action to see if this exact thing has failed before. \"log\" manually records a fault outside the automatic tool-call path (e.g. from your own reasoning about something that went wrong).",
        "updatedAt": 1789871665581,
        "_key": "fault_log"
      },
      {
        "id": "roundtable",
