        "provides": "Scan a subtree for real JS syntax errors via `node --check` (same mechanism scripts/precommit-check.js uses for staged files, applied here to an arbitrary scope). Returns ONLY files that fail, with the real error — a clean subtree returns an explicit pass, not silence.",
        "updatedAt": 1789871665599,
        "_key": "nexus.syntax_debug.tool"
      }
    ],
